  "bodyHash": "30642052d0f01e43",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:36px\"><strong>足</strong><strong>够</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>多</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:36px\"> <strong>的</strong><strong> </strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:36px\"><strong>效</strong></span><span style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:36px\"><strong>果</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\"> <strong>描</strong></span><span style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:36px\"><strong>述</strong></span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:36px\"><strong> </strong> </span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#008080\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"color:#008080\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries YouTube\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 关于 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">足够多的效果描述（JEED）是一个 JEI/REI/EMI 插件，提供有关状态效果的有用信息。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组添加了一个新的“效果”配方分类，您可以通过在 JEI 物品界面点击新添加的状态效果图标，或在背包界面点击其方框中的活跃效果来访问它。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在这里，您可以查看此类状态效果的相关信息，例如提供它的物品、效果描述、来源模组以及效果颜色。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P8qv5ZN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UfGgoGG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🧪 自定义 🧪</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组会自动将所有注册的状态效果添加到其页面中，然而模组添加的效果将不包含描述。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任何人都可以通过在资源包的本地化文件中添加字符串 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">\"effect.[mod_id].[effect_name].description\"</span> 轻松为他们的效果添加此类描述。理想情况下，这应由模组开发者自行完成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">作为模组开发者，您还可以使用 <em>JeedAPI</em> 类为您的屏幕注册屏幕扩展，或使用原版类告诉 Jeed 效果渲染的位置，使其可点击。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由于模组只能自动检测食物类物品作为提供效果的物品，模组开发者也可以通过向模组中添加一些配方，轻松为他们自定义的效果或提供效果的物品添加支持。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为此，只需使用以下两个新增的配方分类之一：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:effect_provider\"</em>，允许您指定一个可以提供效果的物品，格式如下：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:effect_provider\",<br>  \"effect\":  \"minecraft:haste\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:beacon\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n<p>JSON 还可以包含键 \"fluid_providers\" 和 \"effect_providers\"，两者均可分别持有标签或流体与效果的列表。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:potion_provider\"</em>，允许您指定一个可以包含任何已注册药水（例如带附魔箭）的物品：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:potion_provider\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:splash_potion\"<br>    },<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:tipped_arrow\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您希望帮助我为许多模组效果提供内置的描述支持，请务必在我的 Discord 上联系我！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组花费了我大量时间，如果您喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以在这里进行。如果您支持我，您将收到专为您定制的<strong>地球仪</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果您使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用此优惠。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？来看看 Akliz，他们专为模组版 Minecraft 提供顶级品牌服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有非常友好的社区、出色的支持以及出色的服务器体验</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享<strong>&nbsp;20% 折扣</strong>&nbsp;，同时也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"幽灵收割\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之灵\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"储物标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"足够多的效果描述\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡莲\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"进度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"随机矿石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
